          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "10 他回答说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 36,
          "verse": 10,
          "content_chars": 30,
          "text": "“天上的 __MOST_HIGH_A__ 国的奥秘知识已经给你们了，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 46,
          "verse": 12,
          "content_chars": 12,
          "text": "后来魔鬼来把心里的话夺走，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 51,
          "verse": 13,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "他们暂时信了，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 62,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "或放在床下。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 67,
          "verse": 18,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "18 因此，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 69,
          "verse": 18,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "有的人有，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 87,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "”他们上船启航。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 88,
          "verse": 23,
          "content_chars": 3,
          "text": "23 行船时，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 95,
          "verse": 24,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "24 门徒去叫醒他，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 102,
          "verse": 24,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "湖面平静了。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 104,
          "verse": 25,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "“你们的信心在哪里？"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 112,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 15,
          "text": "27 __PERSON_F__ 上了岸，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 114,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "他住在那城里很久，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 115,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "不穿衣服，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 122,
          "verse": 28,
          "content_chars": 12,
          "text": "“__PERSON_F__，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 124,
          "verse": 28,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "你要我怎样？"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 125,
          "verse": 28,
          "content_chars": 3,
          "text": "我求你，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 130,
          "verse": 29,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "虽用锁链锁住，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 136,
          "verse": 30,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "”\n\n“军团，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 153,
          "verse": 35,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "穿着衣服，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 157,
          "verse": 37,
          "content_chars": 12,
          "text": "37 那格拉森全地区的人因害怕，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 159,
          "verse": 37,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "他们就上船离开了。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 165,
          "verse": 39,
          "content_chars": 24,
          "text": "把 __MOST_HIGH_A__ 为你做的事告诉人。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 173,
          "verse": 41,
          "content_chars": 13,
          "text": "41 有一个名叫亚伊鲁的会堂领袖，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 180,
          "verse": 44,
          "content_chars": 14,
          "text": "44 有个患血漏十二年的妇女在那里，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 182,
          "verse": 44,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "她来到后面，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 197,
          "verse": 47,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "47 那女人见无法隐瞒，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 208,
          "verse": 49,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "有人从亚伊鲁家来，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 211,
          "verse": 49,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "不要再打扰老师了。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 213,
          "verse": 50,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "50 听见这话，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 219,
          "verse": 51,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "51 到亚伊鲁家，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 224,
          "verse": 52,
          "content_chars": 13,
          "text": "__PERSON_F__ 说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 233,
          "verse": 54,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "起来！"
        }
      ]
